@startuml ArchitectureClassDiagram

title Ares 2 Architecture-Test API

scale max 3799 width
top to bottom direction
hide circle
hide empty members
skinparam ArrowFontSize 9
skinparam classAttributeFontSize 8
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 11
skinparam classMethodFontSize 7
skinparam linetype ortho
' Reduced from the 170/220 starting values because the browser renderer
' rejects the natural 4365-pixel-wide layout.
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam noteFontSize 7
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ranksep 180
skinparam shadowing false

